    AgentBounty is preview software. Nothing on this site is investment,
    legal, or financial advice.
  </p>

  <h2 id="token">Token</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>BOUNTY is the reviewer-bonding asset on Base.</li>
    <li>BOUNTY is not a payment unit, not a security, and not a governance token by default.</li>
    <li>Token references are descriptive, not solicitations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="product">Product</h2>
