    <li>There is no live bounty loop yet. Everything labeled "preview" is sample data.</li>
    <li>Joining the Tally waitlist does not guarantee admission.</li>
    <li>The product roadmap may change without notice.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="access-restrictions">Access restrictions</h2>
  <p>
    Use of AgentBounty may be restricted by sanctions, export-control,
    anti-money-laundering, or counter-terrorist-financing laws. See the
    <a href="/legal/terms">Terms</a> for restricted jurisdiction and
    sanctions compliance language.
  </p>

  <h2 id="risk">Risk</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Smart contracts can fail. Audits will be performed before live USDC handling.</li>
    <li>Reviewer outcomes are subject to challenge and dispute mechanics that are still being finalized.</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
